# Trial-Size Trial by Lightning (otherAreas 28): the battlefield won while completed (a re-run; the entry holds for a
# completed quest). A SMN of level 20 who knows Ramuh (spell 303), the quest completed and the Mini Tuning Fork (GMs):
# the fork's trade to LP_Entrance, option 33, LIGHTNING_GREMLIN+6 killed; 32001's finish: Ramuh known (no message),
# no scroll held: the Scroll of Instant Warp given (ITEM_OBTAINED), Windurst fame +20 again, completeQuest again (no
# change; Quest[4][28]Prog 1 (GM) kept: the raw player:completeQuest).
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=SMN lvl=20
spell 303
quest OtherAreas.TrialSizeTrialByLightning completed
item MiniTuningForkOfLightning
login
trade LP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfLightning x1 # completed: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                    # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
charvar Quest[4][28]Prog 1                # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
kill LIGHTNING_GREMLIN+6                  # won: 32001 (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                    # Ramuh known: nothing; the scroll given; fame +20; completed again
